{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Ambivo Local Gateway","summary":"One OpenAI-compatible endpoint in front of the models on this machine.","description":"An OpenRouter-shaped gateway for local inference. Point any OpenAI client at `/v1` and call a stable alias \u2014 `local/fast`, `local/balanced`, `local/coder`, `local/vision`, `local/embed` \u2014 instead of a concrete model id. Each alias is an ordered chain: the first candidate that is installed and healthy answers, and the rest are failover.\n\nNothing leaves the box. There are no provider keys, because there is no provider.\n\n- `/v1/*` \u2014 the OpenAI-compatible surface (chat, streaming, embeddings, models)\n- `/admin/*` \u2014 install and remove models, inspect what is resident, read usage\n","contact":{"name":"Ambivo, Inc","url":"https://www.ambivo.com/","email":"info@ambivo.com"},"license":{"name":"Proprietary"},"version":"1"},"servers":[{"url":"http://127.0.0.1:4000","description":"Local gateway (default port)"},{"url":"http://localhost:4000","description":"Local gateway (localhost alias)"}],"paths":{"/health":{"get":{"tags":["health"],"summary":"Health","description":"Liveness plus the one fact that matters: can we reach an engine at all.","operationId":"health_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Health Health Get"}}}}}}},"/v1/models":{"get":{"tags":["openai-compatible"],"summary":"List every routable model name","description":"Every routable name: aliases first, then concrete installed models.\n\nAliases are listed even when nothing backing them is installed yet, and\ncarry `installed` so a client can tell \"you can call this\" from \"you must\npull something first\" without a second round trip.","operationId":"list_models_v1_models_get","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response List Models V1 Models Get"},"example":{"object":"list","data":[{"id":"local/fast","object":"model","created":1755300000,"owned_by":"local-gateway","x_local_gateway":{"kind":"alias","candidates":["llama3.2:3b","qwen3:4b","llama3.2:1b"],"installed":["llama3.2:3b","qwen3:4b"],"resolves_to":"llama3.2:3b"}}]}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/chat/completions":{"post":{"tags":["openai-compatible"],"summary":"Create a chat completion (streaming or not)","description":"Standard OpenAI request and response, plus an `x_local_gateway` block carrying what OpenAI's schema has no field for: which backend served it, whether the alias fell through to a backup model, measured tokens/second, and the decoded object when a `response_format` was requested.\n\nWith `stream: true` the response is `text/event-stream`: `chat.completion.chunk` frames, a final frame carrying `usage` and `x_local_gateway`, then `data: [DONE]`. A failure *after* streaming has begun cannot change the status code, so it arrives as a frame with an `error` key before `[DONE]`.","operationId":"chat_completions_v1_chat_completions_post","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ChatCompletionRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{},"example":{"id":"chatcmpl-6f1c2b9a4d3e5f6a7b8c9d0e","object":"chat.completion","created":1755300000,"model":"llama3.2:3b","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Red, blue, and yellow."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":33,"completion_tokens":8,"total_tokens":41},"x_local_gateway":{"backend":"ollama","requested_model":"local/fast","failed_over":false,"tokens_per_second":175.6,"load_ms":163.1,"total_ms":308.4}}}}},"400":{"description":"Malformed request \u2014 bad role, non-data: image URL, oversized image."},"503":{"description":"No candidate in the chain is installed, healthy, or out of cooldown. The message names the `ollama pull` that would fix it.","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"detail":{"message":"no local model available for 'local/vision' (not installed). Try: ollama pull gemma3:4b","type":"backend_error","code":"NoCandidate"}}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/embeddings":{"post":{"tags":["openai-compatible"],"summary":"Embed one string or a batch","operationId":"embeddings_v1_embeddings_post","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EmbeddingRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Embeddings V1 Embeddings Post"},"example":{"object":"list","model":"nomic-embed-text","data":[{"object":"embedding","index":0,"embedding":[0.021,-0.118,0.047]}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":7,"total_tokens":7}}}}},"503":{"description":"No candidate in the chain is installed, healthy, or out of cooldown. The message names the `ollama pull` that would fix it.","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"detail":{"message":"no local model available for 'local/vision' (not installed). Try: ollama pull gemma3:4b","type":"backend_error","code":"NoCandidate"}}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/status":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Status","operationId":"status_admin_status_get","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Status Admin Status Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/running":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Running","description":"Models currently resident in memory, with their footprint.\n\nThe number to watch on a local box: each resident model holds its weights\nuntil `keep_alive` expires, so three 7B models loaded at once is ~15 GB of\nRAM you are not getting back until they idle out.","operationId":"running_admin_running_get","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Running Admin Running Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/models":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Installed Models","description":"Everything on disk, per backend, annotated with catalog metadata.","operationId":"installed_models_admin_models_get","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Installed Models Admin Models Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/models/pull":{"post":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Pull Model","description":"Download one model, streaming Ollama's progress frames as NDJSON.\n\nNDJSON rather than SSE because this is an operator endpoint consumed by\nscripts \u2014 `curl -N ... | jq` works on it directly.","operationId":"pull_model_admin_models_pull_post","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PullRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/models/pull-profile":{"post":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Pull Profile","description":"Download a whole named bundle from the catalog, one model at a time.","operationId":"pull_profile_admin_models_pull_profile_post","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProfileRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/models/{model_id}":{"delete":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Delete Model","description":"Remove a model from disk. `model_id` is a path parameter so tags with a\ncolon (`qwen3:4b`) need no escaping.","operationId":"delete_model_admin_models__model_id__delete","parameters":[{"name":"model_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Model Id"}},{"name":"backend","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Backend"}},{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Delete Model Admin Models  Model Id  Delete"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/catalog/reload":{"post":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Reload Catalog","description":"Re-read models.yaml. Adding a model is a catalog edit, not a restart.","operationId":"reload_catalog_admin_catalog_reload_post","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Reload Catalog Admin Catalog Reload Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/usage":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Usage Summary","operationId":"usage_summary_admin_usage_get","parameters":[{"name":"hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number","default":24.0,"title":"Hours"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":50,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Usage Summary Admin Usage Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"ChatCompletionRequest":{"properties":{"model":{"type":"string","title":"Model","description":"An alias (`local/fast`, `local/balanced`, `local/coder`, `local/vision`, `local/embed`) or a concrete model id (`qwen3:4b`). Unknown ids pass through to the default backend, so anything you `ollama pull` is callable."},"messages":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OpenAIMessage"},"type":"array","title":"Messages","description":"Standard OpenAI messages. `content` is a string, or a list of `text` / `image_url` parts. Images must be inline `data:` URIs."},"max_tokens":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Max Tokens","description":"Output token ceiling."},"max_completion_tokens":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Max Completion Tokens","description":"The newer OpenAI spelling of `max_tokens`; takes precedence."},"temperature":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Temperature"},"top_p":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Top P"},"stop":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Stop"},"stream":{"type":"boolean","title":"Stream","description":"Server-sent events, terminated by `data: [DONE]`.","default":false},"response_format":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Response Format","description":"`{\"type\": \"json_object\"}` or `{\"type\": \"json_schema\", \"json_schema\": {\"name\": ..., \"schema\": {...}}}`. A schema is enforced by constrained decoding, and the decoded object comes back in `x_local_gateway.parsed`."},"think":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Think"}},"type":"object","required":["messages"],"title":"ChatCompletionRequest","examples":[{"max_tokens":128,"messages":[{"content":"Name three primary colors.","role":"user"}],"model":"local/fast"},{"max_tokens":300,"messages":[{"content":"Extract: Acme Corp invoice 8842 for $150.25","role":"user"}],"model":"local/balanced","response_format":{"json_schema":{"name":"invoice","schema":{"properties":{"vendor":{"type":"string"},"invoice_number":{"type":"string"},"amount":{"type":"number"}},"required":["vendor","invoice_number","amount"],"type":"object"}},"type":"json_schema"}},{"max_tokens":64,"messages":[{"content":"Count from 1 to 5.","role":"user"}],"model":"local/fast","stream":true}]},"ContentPart":{"properties":{"type":{"type":"string","title":"Type"},"text":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Text"},"image_url":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ImageUrl"},{"type":"null"}]}},"type":"object","required":["type"],"title":"ContentPart"},"EmbeddingRequest":{"properties":{"model":{"type":"string","title":"Model","description":"An embedding alias or model id.","default":"local/embed"},"input":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"}],"title":"Input","description":"One string, or a batch of strings."}},"type":"object","required":["input"],"title":"EmbeddingRequest","examples":[{"input":["hello world","goodbye"],"model":"local/embed"}]},"HTTPValidationError":{"properties":{"detail":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationError"},"type":"array","title":"Detail"}},"type":"object","title":"HTTPValidationError"},"ImageUrl":{"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","title":"Url"}},"type":"object","required":["url"],"title":"ImageUrl"},"OpenAIMessage":{"properties":{"role":{"type":"string","title":"Role"},"content":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ContentPart"},"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Content"}},"type":"object","required":["role"],"title":"OpenAIMessage"},"ProfileRequest":{"properties":{"profile":{"type":"string","title":"Profile","description":"A profile name from models.yaml: `minimal`, `standard`, or `full`."},"backend":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Backend"}},"type":"object","required":["profile"],"title":"ProfileRequest","examples":[{"profile":"standard"}]},"PullRequest":{"properties":{"model":{"type":"string","title":"Model","description":"Any tag from ollama.com/library, e.g. `qwen3:8b`."},"backend":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Backend","description":"Defaults to the catalog's default backend."}},"type":"object","required":["model"],"title":"PullRequest","examples":[{"model":"gemma3:4b"}]},"ValidationError":{"properties":{"loc":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}]},"type":"array","title":"Location"},"msg":{"type":"string","title":"Message"},"type":{"type":"string","title":"Error Type"}},"type":"object","required":["loc","msg","type"],"title":"ValidationError"}},"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","description":"Only required when the gateway is started with API_KEYS set. On a loopback install, send anything or nothing."}}},"tags":[{"name":"openai-compatible","description":"Drop-in OpenAI surface. Point any OpenAI client at `/v1` with any non-empty api_key and call an alias such as `local/fast`."},{"name":"admin","description":"Operate the box: install and remove models, see what is resident in memory, reload the catalog, read usage."},{"name":"health","description":"Liveness and backend reachability."}],"security":[{},{"bearerAuth":[]}]}